{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02541","headline":"奉和行经破薛举战地应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和行经破薛举战地应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"混元分大象，长策挫修鲸。\n於斯建宸极，由此创鸿名。\n一戎乾宇泰，千祀德流清。\n垂衣凝庶绩，端拱铸羣生。\n复整瑶池驾，还临官渡营。\n周游寻曩迹，旷望动天情。\n帷宫面丹浦，帐殿瞩宛城。\n虏场栖九穗，前歌被六英。\n战地甘泉涌，阵处景云生。\n普天沾凯泽，相携欣颂平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}